{"id":281463173,"title":"1.Day1","summary":"这个是我们依赖的核心包把其他多余的文件删去我们的入口文件保留这一点就好了。","content":"<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786781709705-136749c2-5282-4907-9abd-99bdf11b3721.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786781818274-243b0c17-44ca-4b27-8f8a-d0106eeb93e0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786782318013-55e27600-fdd9-40ff-b213-3878685276a1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786782537151-28592deb-e071-4fe8-992e-db7a89615f49.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786782545122-6ee1058c-dbab-4a83-af57-bd740b4bdad6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这个是我们依赖的核心包<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786783020519-824f91f3-72e0-4b2f-a8dd-963a258cac4f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>把其他多余的文件删去<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786783228005-febaeb69-245a-4842-aae7-b04a83af0483.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们的入口文件保留这一点就好了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786795290327-4affde28-3936-4961-a0c7-7192dde9e2d7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786795363048-e9279321-5b38-4d22-b54a-02051bca13e1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786795404181-6414210c-cef8-4772-aab3-e09cf74e2195.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>JSX基础--概念和本质</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786795625830-ae45df0a-a2dd-4640-ba41-5f6c34a22a5a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786795738393-07cf8aa0-3e96-4085-97a1-2237b385a456.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>JSX基础--识别js表达式</strong></p>\n<p><strong>4个高频使用场景</strong><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786796013135-08a4a7fc-5ebf-44ed-bd55-af6bb804b2ea.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786796195647-7bc3c8fe-241c-49f9-a50e-c1d0bf7237a3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786796228293-527562cb-4feb-46c5-abbf-f9b9c59999d6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786796310884-3e0c8347-709a-49eb-bdbc-e7f584097001.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>JSX基础--实现列表渲染</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786796395871-7deed9c4-c4e6-4894-80a1-5613306915e9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786796656331-8661a412-2e55-4d6a-b643-604aeeb3881a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这里要求我们在重复的元素身上绑定一个key，key里面要求是一个独一无二的值。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786796768621-9634c8f1-72d7-487f-b49a-42914f38f26e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>核心的方法是map，你要循环哪个结构，我们就在main方法里面return 哪个结构</p>\n<p> 小结：写 map 循环渲染列表，<strong>必须给循环出来的最外层标签加上 key，值用数据唯一 id</strong>。  </p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786796961895-fc1f77eb-9346-4b2c-8617-8d577e696afb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>JSX基础--实现基础条件渲染</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786797804096-a8b5ba3b-c5da-480f-b5bf-7722604178fd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786797939447-460d3470-55e9-4672-8151-1b7f9f55c80a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>JSX基础--实现复杂条件渲染</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786798101976-8367024b-acfb-4f59-ab75-9c420d070bf9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>React中的事件绑定</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786798181434-e38ec190-e695-42aa-963c-f06acd6d67fe.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786798237707-03f92ef1-80b3-457c-aad4-9d9ffd73f1f9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786798288960-ff93b6ec-c243-4826-9a45-faab26dcd338.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这里一定得是箭头函数的写法！</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786798376161-4e7f07af-3cc0-46bc-804f-9bf09c0e5cbc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786799153219-c2309d29-6f22-49d4-81e3-fcff8f9dd3d9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786799187303-cb54bc1f-a01d-44c3-a764-d6f4743c2703.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>React组件基础的使用</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786799297760-c7dc1e8b-1124-414b-bfd9-b658a7022ce7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786799378444-515dc67a-f548-45cb-9ff4-55eb5855c1fb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786799431021-5c6c2e6d-736d-492a-9968-de6ffb2be312.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>写成箭头函数的写法<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786799504063-0c63c34f-1a89-4403-bc9e-d80abdf30cde.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>useState基础的使用</strong></p>\n<p>第一个是状态变量，第2个是函数，用来修改我们的count的</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786799572569-4d8361e7-26c2-493d-81bf-f410464a39ee.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786799853269-66ce28fd-8a95-47e0-acaf-6858c524e2d8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>useState修改状态的规则</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786799996122-3f9bd30b-3382-4248-9db8-5832c3d64756.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>count++只会在控制台那边起变化，页面是不会有变化的。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786800051290-365e3a69-a122-4fb7-9afc-353f5c9b2db0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786800466488-cbf429f8-634e-4ab6-b048-59cd1302389d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786800580728-ad60edb9-a0f7-4ac9-9b82-fc5e850d7d7d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>基础样式控制</strong></p>\n<p>这个一定是要叫className</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786800637073-32f51f3c-2f0d-4052-bf48-e541d4c963c4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786800779958-d2be8e38-9074-4a1f-b27d-c4ac9573d3ea.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786800815048-4683b2a4-a3a0-4b79-8962-5f08c366efb0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786800867497-139a668f-670a-4723-8580-23eaaa64733c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786800856608-b4c9bcbb-972a-4089-9260-0c34b3e7922d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>classnames工具优化类名控制</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786800983981-c5885cca-0f46-4dfa-8a26-f622f02ad0f9.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787210256890-d5b3c772-6c5a-4134-906a-5e6bf956214b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>使用前要求安装<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786801011006-59c47c17-32f0-44ed-92ba-8e59a07a92de.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1786801033065-dad0f953-9949-4974-8049-40aa3f9f3408.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":82407692,"category":{"id":82407692,"name":"React","description":""},"created_at":"2026-08-15T05:55:45.000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T07:17:42.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/rlg5dd/vsknpu0wtb1edwym","slug":"vsknpu0wtb1edwym","wordCount":331}